"Proving a disjunction can be tricky and we'll develop strategies to tackle these kinds of goals later on. That being said, sometimes it's easy! Like in this level here. In order to tell Lean that we intend to directly prove the *left* side of this disjunction we need the tactic...\n"
"### **❯ The §0 and §1 tactics**\n"
